      "gm": "",
      "value": "<div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Requirements</strong> Farum is charged.</p><hr></div><p>You invoke Tirranos to unleash Farum’s power in a blast of magic. The blast targets one creature within 30 feet, dealing @Damage[(floor(@actor.level/4))d12[force]] damage with a @Check[reflex|against:class-spell|basic] save. The force damage increases by 1d12 at 8th level and every 4 levels after. Farum is no longer charged.</p>"
